{"reviews":[{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-0","r":5.0,"t":"DRIES LAYERS OF POLISH QUICKLY","x":"I have used this product for years.  Even on top of different nail items such  as calcium gel, Icky Sticky adhesive, 2 coats of nail polish and another quick dry product, I put this on top.  Within about 5 minutes, my nails are dry enough to use on  easy tasks as in typing or dusting.  It never smudges the polish.  IT'S THE BEST product out there in my opinion and lasts until I do my nails again every 10 days to 2 weeks.  I've even given it as a gift with a bottle of polish to girlfriends'  birt","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-1","r":5.0,"t":"Best top coat I've ever used","x":"This top coat does exactly what it says. It helps your polish dry fast as well as adding a beautiful shine and it makes my manicure last much longer than other top coats! Other fast drying top coats I've tried turn stringy or creat bubbles, but this one gives me the perfect finish!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-2","r":5.0,"t":"Out the Door Fast Dry Polish is the greatest thing since sliced Bread!!!!","x":"Out the Door Fast Dry is exactly that. Put on you nails and they are dry. I must say that I make sure to let the top coat dry the put on &#34;Out the Door&#34;. It dries so fast, it's amazing. I don't know how I lived without this fast drying topcoat in the past!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-3","r":5.0,"t":"Name says it all...great product!","x":"Love that I can paint my nails before bed, put on this product and within a couple minutes they are good to go!  No more sheet prints on my nails in the morning!  It also seems to make my polish last longer!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-4","r":1.0,"t":"Lots of chips on nails","x":"I previously purchased this item in a beauty supply store and I loved it.  It sells out so quickly that the supply store runs out before I can get a bottle. The product worked great and lasted for days. This bottle that I ordered on Amazon doesn't last but a few hours before my nails start chipping and have a dull appearance. Very disappointing. Going back to the beauty supply and hoping they have some on the shelf.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-5","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE","x":"I have been using this product for over 20 years and I swear by it.  I refuse to paint my own nails without this, because I don't have the patience to sit and let the paint dry for an hour.  With this quick dry polish, your nails are seriously dry in minutes.  I am talking D R Y.  To where you can go about your day and the polish doesn't smudge or smear at all.  And the shine it gives to your nails....so pretty!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-6","r":5.0,"t":"Best top coat EVER","x":"I have always had a problem with being still long enough for my nails to dry with a perfect finish.  Even with fast-drying polishes.  This product does it.  No fingerprints, sheet prints, just gorgeous nails.  Originally received from a friend who had trained, but never became a professional manicurist.  She recently said to me she wished her self-manicures came out as pretty as mine.  I think that was a first.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-7","r":5.0,"t":"My fav topcoat!","x":"This is my favorite topcoat! I used to be able to find it in the store, but I haven\u2019t been able to find it for a while. I was excited to see it on Amazon! I am super impatient when it comes to waiting for my nails to dry, and this works great for that. Speeds up dry time and improves durability of your polish.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-8","r":1.0,"t":"No good","x":"I don't know if I got a bad bottle or what but this stuff is by no means fast. 15 minutes and I barely bumped my finger and my polish just slid off. I'm so disappointed. I decided to give this a try because of these rave reviews but I'm going back to my Sache Vite. This stuff stinks.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-9","r":5.0,"t":"This is my all-time fav top coat!!!!","x":"This is my all-time favorite clear fast dry top coat! I've been ordering up for years and will continue to do so! I can't say enough great things about Out The Door top coat!!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-10","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome product Great price","x":"Absolutely a great deal. I\u2019m hooked on this stuff. I\u2019m even going to bring it to the nail salon for them to use it because they use some generic garbage.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-11","r":5.0,"t":"Saves time & works great!","x":"I love this quick dry polish. It works great and saves time, especially when you\u2019re in a hurry to get out the door and want your nails to look great!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-12","r":5.0,"t":"Appropriate Name","x":"Appropriate name. Use color, two coats, top with Out the Door. Give it a few minutes and you\u2019re done. Great product for fast drying.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great stuff","x":"This top coat dries very quickly, adds a nice shine and helps keep polish fresh longer than other top coats I\u2019ve tried.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-14","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome!","x":"I have used this for years. It really does dry fast and protect my nails. If you haven\u2019t ever tried it, you should!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-15","r":5.0,"t":"Dries Fast!","x":"I can do my nails and put this on as top coat and within 20 mins I can go to bed and wake up  with my nails perfect!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-16","r":5.0,"t":"The reviews are true","x":"A friend recommended this to me and it is amazing. It does really dry very fast and with a high sheen that I like.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-17","r":5.0,"t":"Fast drying is no joke!","x":"I absolutely love this nail polish! It dries your nail polish so quickly! Best thing I never knew I needed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great  product.","x":"I\u2019ve used this product before so I knew what I was getting. Delivery  was on time and item was correct.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-19","r":5.0,"t":"My favorite topcoat!","x":"I love this topcoat...it dries so fast. Not much more to say except that I order it again and again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product","x":"I have been using this product for at least 15 years, it is very good as a topcoat and fast drying .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-21","r":5.0,"t":"Very quick drying time.","x":"Post office took 10 days to deliver. not sellers fault. Love this top coat, have used it for years.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-22","r":5.0,"t":"It dries fast","x":"This topcoat makes your nails look just like they've been done.  It's the best one I have found.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-23","r":5.0,"t":"Dries really fast","x":"I love this stuff! Could not find it at my drugstore anymore. Great fast drying top coat!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09SBT3VJB-24","r":5.0,"t":"Love this stuff","x":"My manicure isn't complete unless I use this product. It dries fast and seals my polish.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers widely praise the product for drying nail polish very quickly, often within minutes.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,7,8,12,13,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers say it makes their manicure last longer and improves durability.","cites":[2,4,8,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers note it adds a nice shine and a smooth, perfect finish without bubbles or smudges.","cites":[2,7,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers report negative experiences, including chipping within hours or polish sliding off and not drying fast.","cites":[5,9]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers mention being long-time, loyal users of the product.","cites":[1,6,10,15]}]},"qa":[]}